<title>GERMANY: BayernVerein - 96 profit should benefit shareholders.</title>
<headline>BayernVerein - 96 profit should benefit shareholders.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bayerische Vereinsbank AG said on Friday that its shareholders should profit from its projected improvement in 1996 earnings.</p>
<p>In a statement released ahead of a news conference, the BayernVerein also said it expected double digit growth in earnings this year.</p>
<p>In the first nine months of 1996, the bank's operating profits after provisions rose 17.5 percent to one billion marks.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
